<title>cbodotnet — .NET SDK builds</title>
<style>
body { max-width: 68em; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; color: #111; background: white; font: 17px/1.45 Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
h1 { margin-bottom: .15em; font-size: 2em; }
h2 { margin-top: 1.5em; font-size: 1.3em; }
a { color: #0000b8; }
a:visited { color: #551a8b; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; text-align: left; }
th, td { padding: .55em .8em .55em 0; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }
